Sval: Remove Copy Text From Image

The image context menu's text recognition goes whole, down to the
platform: the menu item and its dialog component, the context-menu actor
messages, the chrome-only HTMLImageElement.recognizeCurrentImageText and
its ImageText dictionary, the content-process request for it, the
image's text-selection UA widget, nsIXULRuntime's
isTextRecognitionSupported, and the macOS Vision implementation behind
them, with the pref, strings and tests.

